{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c8f0a29b20856267a90133fafcab02ceeba4bdf8d49811f425d956c1ef7d2705", "ja": "大好き、だから！！！", "zh": "因为，最喜欢了！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dc256cbb9aefabd44a08b318899518221de0bc59cdd3ccc64e6bc166cdc8cebc", "ja": "部室に向かう途中、ちなは緑生にサークルの\r\n過去を話す。神作家Lichtへの崇拝、\r\n尊敬、妬みなどが原因となり、大量の退部者\r\nが出たと。緑生も似た経験があったが、それ\r\nでも同人誌が好きだから戻って来たと語る。", "zh": "在前往社团活动室的途中，ちな向緑生讲述了社团的过去。由于对神作家Licht的崇拜、敬仰以及嫉妒等情绪，曾有大量成员退社。緑生也有过类似的经历，但即便如此，因为喜欢同人志，还是回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1002_narration", "source_sha256": "376a8ebe53e315c99640aed8200181e59ef05bdf58ac2fc978b24da1bdac5a3c", "ja": "あの時、サークルの部室に向かう途中。\n偶然一緒になったふたりは、こんな話をしていた……", "zh": "那时，在前往社团活动室的路上。\n偶然走到一起的两人，曾聊过这样的话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "3e01601779c25d3da9bb2598959cb2372cd901f0d5cddb82c90449bab5f5b704", "ja": "トーコ！　もしかして、\n今からサークルに行くところ？", "zh": "透子！你该不会\n正要去社团吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "f1941168bf0305e707303ea998046f04a55f7c47280c053c0567ab099deaf3c1", "ja": "千花夏。\nええ、一緒に向かいましょうか。", "zh": "千花夏。\n嗯，我们一起过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "79b395c831e717b65af083235cf70ebc05efac392bde0eea72e403de6ac1b228", "ja": "サークル、いい人ばかりでよかったわ。\n部員はもっといるのかと思っていたけど。", "zh": "社团里的人都很好，真是太好了。\n我还以为会有更多成员，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "6f609f93edd0bfb3269033ae5dacd2c28137943243ae3d2c9c867484dcf3bf91", "ja": "あー……うん。前は、部員が結構いたんだけど。\n去年、大量に辞めちゃって……。", "zh": "啊……嗯。以前其实有挺多部员的。\n但去年退了好多人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "4b39b7bd4be6dda4c9f6e9dea13e515d20f4411f6cd59ee6e6bea2e6081e4b75", "ja": "残ったのは、Lichtと私だけ。その後、新入生で\nシンカちゃんとりこちゃんが入ってきたんだ。", "zh": "剩下的只有Licht和我。后来，シンカ和りこ作为新生加入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "90fdf74348720cc606a7573b87c14896c67d22253880f40999ad8ecaba150ffe", "ja": "そう……。よくある事だとは思うけど、\n理由を聞いておいた方がいい？", "zh": "这样啊……我觉得这应该是常有的事，不过，要不要先问问原因？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "1055bf5d037378e17d057ee9aaf311bd27d56a0f270e52838eaaf4940877e800", "ja": "トーコは文字書きだから、大丈夫かな。\n……あんまりいい話じゃないよ？", "zh": "托子是写文章的人，应该没问题吧。\n……这可不是什么好事哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "34fdab69a26f5c483e0ef35dc76900799651dc762cf0767004a879b273e74c09", "ja": "構わない。", "zh": "没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "3ee7b92a9abb0de2ea5a3e31fcc37339350ca3dc389cf35429960b5bb487946a", "ja": "部員がみんな、Lichtに夢中だったから……かな。\nLichtに憧れて、羨んで。取り巻きになって……。", "zh": "大概是因为部员们全都沉迷于Licht吧……\n憧憬着Licht，又羡慕着Licht。最后成了他们的跟班……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "45fbe190cb1d3d935a46186d307cfd3d64f3541f76567e8f408b97bda222b053", "ja": "仲間だったはずなのに、上下関係ができて。\n陰口を叩いたり、足を引っ張るような事もして。", "zh": "明明应该是同伴，却渐渐形成了上下级关系。还会说对方坏话，甚至做出拖后腿之类的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "01ad4f2e27cc182308709c7055f4137b7d6b493e4d318fd8a996fb44a522e3a5", "ja": "私はレイヤーだから、直接被害はなかったけど。\nでも、売り子を頼まれただけで妬まれたりはしたかな。", "zh": "因为我是Coser，所以没有直接受到伤害。不过，只是被拜托去帮忙卖东西，也会被人嫉妒就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "1d2d5df095d786b57d517659031b04075ba4cde2b65c881aa36a8182a06396e4", "ja": "そんな事が……。\nどんな場所でも、似たような事があるのね。", "zh": "居然还有这种事……\n看来无论在哪里，都会发生类似的事情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "676c9d5e84154f63396c40cb9b9f7e280764e7dde7a246b60ccecb4e4f3f0a9c", "ja": "トーコも、デビューしてすぐ、同人で書いてた\nマイナージャンルの本、発掘されてたよね。", "zh": "东子也是，刚出道没多久，自己以前同人创作的冷门题材作品就被人翻出来了，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "fcb324df242d9340e83dd2eb773e063bf812f145fca50c442fa00334569c5965", "ja": "ええ。そのジャンルの人に、「目立つ人がいると困る」\n「隠れて楽しんでるのに」とか、いろいろ言われたわ。", "zh": "是的。那个圈子里的人对我说了很多话，比如“有显眼的人在会很困扰”“明明是在偷偷享受的”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "3bb50272e3fd90331a0a951ba267c83c49db76223b4f1979053a284d3345a491", "ja": "ちょうどその頃、賞をもらって……連載の話を\n頂いたから。商業に専念する事にしたの。", "zh": "正好那时候我得了奖……又接到了连载的邀约。所以，我决定专心从事商业创作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "e83edffe4d59ec26bf38c234c04eee19f3b4c05b5e9506ec8ce2837f3b93dd03", "ja": "やっぱり、そうだったんだ。あんなに好きだった\nジャンルを急に止めたから……気になってたんだけど。", "zh": "果然是这样啊。你突然放弃了那么喜欢的\n题材……我之前还一直挺在意的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "b30157aaf7c3a5a9754074359cce7fc2b7521f592b24d47f0a0626772f9c7bee", "ja": "その頃に聞かれても、\nうまく話せなかったと思うから。", "zh": "就算是在那段时间被问起，我想自己也没法好好说清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "2ccb320d7c78e59588de4d23255060ba2c3484c9df9c9f7c6cdcaf4d5ef8613e", "ja": "それに……同人活動は、\nイヤな思い出ばかりじゃないもの。", "zh": "而且……同人活动也不全是让人不愉快的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "2955e6797064c4688706a168e42ecf0b523cb5c95fe1311213a19f631c165e36", "ja": "……だから、また始めてみようと思った？", "zh": "……所以，才想着再重新开始做做看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "7cd2d87e617da458d7753cd705c87f7f932214ca57c037254dc20c4769add7fc", "ja": "ええ。商業は面白いけど、売れるために必要なのは、\n才能や努力だけじゃないから。流行や、運も必要……。", "zh": "是的。商业很有意思，但想要卖得好，需要的不只是才能和努力。还需要顺应潮流，以及运气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "2a2f2bb614ec7f7c8232cc5c7aba899a3619657ddcb4947af40c5acc8de506a2", "ja": "でも、そこにはない……時代と合っていなくても、\n素晴らしいと感じる才能は、たくさん存在しているわ。", "zh": "可是，那些并不在那里……世上有许多才华，即使与时代不合，也依然令人感叹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "c9b0f189f528b7c5a741b216ecf14f430211855bd713f7c7c78c29ad459431f5", "ja": "私はそういう作品を見つける事に、喜びを見出すの。\n……きっと、好きなんだと思う。同人誌が。", "zh": "发现这样的作品，会让我感到喜悦。\n……我想，我一定是喜欢同人志的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "0284cc2415163201a28eb88eaa1ab982f616a492e2bf1a24487749c7cc1f110a", "ja": "そっか。トーコらしいね。", "zh": "这样啊。很有透子的风格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "627a8fce5828f48b16a56590f5bbebb0f8e4d34b21a1dbd84714d4e0554d8aea", "ja": "そう？\nでも、千花夏だって同じでしょう？", "zh": "是吗？\n不过，千花夏不也一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "a2198082dc4a44e1538309b045378fed2b4a97da14b6d70558e07859be792a72", "ja": "嫌な事があっても、サークルをやめなかったじゃない。\nレイヤー活動なら、個人だっていいはずなのに。", "zh": "就算遇到了不开心的事，你也并没有退出社团不是吗？\n如果是出Cosplay，明明个人也可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "7bd5cb0e0289718fbc640bbc6f3c7fb8ee465fea33b3930118ff074640960525", "ja": "それは……そうだね。私は衣装作りやコスプレが\n専門だけど、同人誌や同人活動は、大好きだよ。", "zh": "那是……没错。我专长是制作服装和Cosplay，但我也很喜欢同人志和同人活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "628effede907a3c7b5162b826952b6729bd22c2bd5995f9777849f895767a4b9", "ja": "徹夜で衣装を作って、なんでこんな大変な思いをして\n……って思っても、また帰ってきちゃうんだよね。", "zh": "彻夜赶制衣服的时候，就算心里想着“为什么要\n受这份罪啊……”可最后还是会回到这里来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "533bd003bb6ad64a4c3ac0ae9ed73d6d43ae11d0cb0b0644ca5c5a1fbeeb731d", "ja": "私達は、コミベのメインストリームではないけれど。\n『好き』と『表現』に、貴賤はないはずだから。", "zh": "虽然我们不是ComiBe的主流，但喜欢与表达本身，应该没有高低贵贱之分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "1a01a6dc1389ebfc7af8d0131e2fc0ee6a43c8d1a899a96a8acebcec6ac23642", "ja": "うん。……私は私のやり方で、\nそれを証明してみせるよ！", "zh": "嗯。……我会用我自己的方式，\n来证明给所有人看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "9c93beffad832837bc335296ceb5eb42e684654407582d3e9ea189aeeec60638", "ja": "ねえ、トーコ。せっかくサークルに入ったんだし、\nレイヤー活動も再開しない？　衣装なら作るよ？", "zh": "喂，冬子。好不容易加入了社团，要不要也重新开始玩Cosplay？服装我来做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "2c5d81804f26de0e72220df6dc2f2e6d2298f99cac2fd243f5e88f54f12fd46a", "ja": "再開って……私は別に、レイヤーじゃないし。\n千花夏が着ろっていうから、着ただけでしょ。", "zh": "复出什么的……我又不是coser。还不是因为千花夏让我穿，我才穿的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_05_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "eb40f4d5dec6d0c1bf1179f3118c2980f20a9eaa17756faea5b954c538125a3e", "ja": "え？　でも、結構ポーズとか決めてたよね？\n「宵闇（ヨイ）さん、視線もらっていいですか～？」", "zh": "诶？可是你不是还摆了不少姿势吗？\n“宵闇小姐，能看我这边吗～？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
